# Art Tracker standards

- Use Next.js App Router pages in `app/`. Put UI in `components/`, utilities in `lib/`, and HTTP handlers in `app/api/`.
- Keep strict TypeScript interfaces for artwork, museum, Met Museum, check-in, and gamification payloads in `lib/types.ts`. Do not pass loosely typed API JSON into the UI.
- Follow WCAG: visible focus, labeled form controls, landmarks, skip link, image alt text, and live regions for async status.
- Maps go through Mapbox (`NEXT_PUBLIC_MAPBOX_TOKEN`). Photo verification goes through Gemini 1.5 Flash Vision in `lib/gemini.ts`.
